#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Foto's van jou gesig waarmee Ubuntu Hello vergelyk word. Hou ten minste "
"twee, aangeteken in verskillende beligting."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Wys tans gestoorde modelle vir:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Slegs een gesigmodel is ingeskryf. Beligting verander hoe jou gesig vir die "
"kamera lyk, so 'n enkele model kan saans onder lampe (of in daglig) misluk. "
"Voeg 'n tweede model by wat in ander lig aangeteken is om die ontsluiting "
"betroubaar te hou op enige tyd van die dag."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Voeg 'n tweede model by"

